# RFC-0016 K8b (section 12 item 4): the pairwise figure's floor.
# family<TAB>covered pairs<TAB>pair universe. Measured over the union of
# each family's two suites (tsymex_0016_k8b_<family>_a/_b, familyFiles);
# K1 judges it. It only rises. Measured on linux-c; a full run on that
# row holds the figure to its floor (above it fails until the floor is
# raised); other rows are held only at or above it. A changed universe
# size (a dimension changed) must be re-measured.
family:callshape	55	55
family:exnmemory	61	61
family:generic	47	47
